anister in the neck of the device and  this will cause the inflatable helmet to  be filled with helium gas in half a  second  people in a big industry and told us  that what we were trying to do was  impossible and it was a great feeling to  prove them wrong  seven years later we asked him to  simulate a bicycle accident all right  here we go okay that didn't work  a bit
 

